              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3}{2x}-\\frac{1}{x}&=\\frac{3}{2x}-\\frac{2}{2x}\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2x}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
